# SPA routing for Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
#
# Campaign slugs and donor status tokens are created in the browser and cannot be
# prerendered, so every unknown path has to return the app shell. Without this,
# Cloudflare Pages falls back to 404.html — which is the same shell, so the app
# still loads, but every deep link answers with an HTTP 404 status.
#
# Static files that exist are served first; this only catches what does not.
# GitHub Pages ignores this file and uses 404.html instead.

